		<h1>This site is not set up yet</h1>
		<p>Set the host app env vars <code>config</code> (JSON with <code>firebase.projectId</code>, <code>firebase.apiKey</code>, <code>firebase.authDomain</code>) and <code>googleJson</code> (service account), then restart.</p>
		<p>Once it runs, a root user can see what is still missing at <code>/__core/health</code> and the install plan at <code>/__core/install/plan</code>.</p>
